# unfocused-pacing.xrs - the session-33 regression, on a desk.
#
# Losing FOCUSED is what collapsed the frame rate in session 33. The sim can
# command that transition, so the bug is now a repeatable test instead of an
# accident that needed a headset to reproduce.
#
# Watch the MOD log while this runs: expect "xr: session state VISIBLE" and then
# "xr: SUBMISSION IDLE (reason=...)" within about 5 s, then "FOCUSED again".
reset
@frames 30
@assert sessionState eq FOCUSED
focus lose
@wait 6000
@assert sessionState eq VISIBLE
focus regain
@wait 2000
@assert sessionState eq FOCUSED
